{"ticker":"NFL","symbol":"NFL","instrumentId":3023072,"name":"National Fertilizers","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Agricultural","about":"National Fertilizers Ltd. (NFL) is a major public sector undertaking in India, engaged in the manufacturing and marketing of fertilizers, primarily urea, along with bio-fertilizers and industrial chemicals. The company operates five state-of-the-art manufacturing plants across India, producing high-quality fertilizers that support sustainable agricultural growth. NFL also provides various agro-inputs and advisory services to farmers, promoting efficient farming practices. The company’s extensive distribution network ensures timely availability of fertilizers across the country, contributing significantly to India’s food security. NFL’s commitment to innovation, quality, and environmental sustainability positions it as a key player in the Indian fertilizer industry.","website":"www.nationalfertilizers.com","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:43:35.406Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":63.82,"changePct":0.6148510168689904,"week52High":91.66,"week52Low":57.12},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹3,131 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹21,531 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"122,644,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"53"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"26,119,100"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.63%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.1"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.12"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.45"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"7.71"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"5–48"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"7.4%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-27.35"},{"label":"Volume","value":"720,796"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"622,633"},{"label":"Master score","value":"47"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"64"},{"label":"